# Database Migrations

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the project database.

## Creating a new migration

After changing SQLAlchemy models, generate a migration:

    uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Always review the generated migration file before applying it.

## Applying migrations

Apply all pending migrations:

    uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head

## Checking migration status

Show the current database revision:

    uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini current

Show migration history:

    uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini history

## Rolling back migrations

Downgrade the latest migration:

    uv run alembic -c backend/alembic.ini downgrade -1

## Migration files

Migration scripts are stored in:

    alembic/versions/

Each migration contains:
- upgrade() - applies database changes
- downgrade() - reverts database changes